"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2305190/extras/9c93f95dd91b4bc2b5106a1a0ac1f979.webp?t=1748448705\" /></span><i>You are part of an elite response team tasked with containing the anomaly and banishing the Entity.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i> Stay sharp, adapt fast, and take back the space before it\u2019s too late.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Key Features:</i></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Operate as a team or split up to complete critical objectives</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Scan anomalies to uncover distortions in reality</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Repair infrastructure to stabilize the environment</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Use SSA technology to locate and weaken the Entity</i></p></li></ul>",
